 {
  "id": "s22",
  "start": 138.46,
  "props": {
   "kind": "claudeResponse",
   "prompt": "Remove the \"Do you have pets?\" question from the booking form.",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "text": "I removed the \"Do you have pets?\" question from the booking form. That answer was also used to keep cleaners with a cat allergy away from homes with pets, so I changed two other places to keep that protection working. I haven't run the app to check these changes.",
     "gap": 0
    },
    {
     "text": "`index.html`: the question and its Yes/No buttons are gone.",
     "bullet": true,
     "gap": 14
    },
    {
     "text": "`js/booking.js`: the form no longer sends a pets answer. New bookings now have no pets answer saved, which means \"unknown\".",
     "bullet": true,
     "gap": 4
    },
    {
     "text": "`js/matching.js`: auto-assign now treats \"unknown\" as \"may have pets\" and only allows an allergic cleaner when a booking is marked as having no pets.",
     "bullet": true,
     "gap": 4
    },
    {
     "text": "`js/admin.js`: the staff page shows Unknown instead of No when there's no pets answer.",
     "bullet": true,
     "gap": 4
    },
    {
     "text": "What this means for staff:",
     "gap": 16
    },
    {
     "text": "**Allergic cleaners are skipped by default:** auto-assign won't pick a cleaner with a cat allergy for a new booking until someone sets the pets answer with the staff page's existing edit checkbox.",
     "bullet": true,
     "gap": 4
    },
    {
     "text": "**Marking \"no pets\" takes two clicks:** the checkbox starts unticked for unknown bookings, so a staff member has to tick it and then untick it.",
     "bullet": true,
     "gap": 4
    },
    {
     "text": "**No pet-friendly badge:** the \"Needs pet-friendly cleaner\" badge only appears when a booking is marked as having pets.",
     "bullet": true,
     "gap": 4
    },
    {
     "text": "The database still has the pets column, the pet fee and the Pets column on the staff page. I left them alone so staff can still record pets.",
     "gap": 16
    }
   ],
   "streamStart": -5,
   "streamDur": 1,
   "hl": [
    {
     "t0": 0.3,
     "t1": 14.699999999999989,
     "blocks": [
      6
     ]
    }
   ],
   "size": 25,
   "title": "claude · ~/app · supabase (read-only)",
   "dur": 14.7
  }
 },
